Package: music-player
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Tsiry Sandratraina <tsiry.sndr@aol.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/tsirysndr/music-player
Depends: libc6, libasound2, libfontconfig1, libxkbcommon0
Description: Extensible music player with terminal and Slint desktop clients
 music-player is an extensible music player daemon and client. This package
 includes the command-line and terminal interface, the skinnable Slint desktop
 application, an application-menu entry, and its icon.
